   "text": "路 A：AshAgent —— 编译（正确的形态）",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "路 A：AshAgent —— 编译（正确的形态）",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "boundElements": [],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "pax",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 72,
   "y": 300,
   "width": 324,
   "height": 220,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#a0a0a0",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 10,
   "version": 1,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "text": "① manifest 说 agent 看到什么\n   tool_panels/default.yaml\n     agent_tools:\n       - name: run_tests      ← agent 看到的名字\n         runtime_tool: shell  ← 实际调用的\n         arguments: [command] ← 只暴露这一个参数\n\n② compile_panel() 逐条核对：\n   · shell 这个 runtime 工具存在吗\n   · command 这个参数 runtime 真接受吗\n   · runtime 必填的参数你提供了吗\n   ✗ 任何一条不对 → 抛异常，不启动\n\n③ 产出：schema + 路由表\n   agent 调 run_tests(command=…)\n   → route() → runtime 收到 shell(command=…)",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "① manifest 说 agent 看到什么\n   tool_panels/default.yaml\n     agent_tools:\n       - name: run_tests      ← agent 看到的名字\n         runtime_tool: shell  ← 实际调用的\n         arguments: [command] ← 只暴露这一个参数\n\n② compile_panel() 逐条核对：\n   · shell 这个 runtime 工具存在吗\n   · command 这个参数 runtime 真接受吗\n   · runtime 必填的参数你提供了吗\n   ✗ 任何一条不对 → 抛异常，不启动\n\n③ 产出：schema + 路由表\n   agent 调 run_tests(command=…)\n   → route() → runtime 收到 shell(command=…)",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "boundElements": [],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "autoResize": true
  },
