   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 41,
   "version": 1,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "text": "分三步做，每步能单独验证",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "分三步做，每步能单独验证",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "boundElements": [],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "planx",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 660,
   "width": 605,
   "height": 180,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#a0a0a0",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 42,
   "version": 1,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "text": "第一步  把 manifest 加载搬到能共用的位置\n        现在 load_panel / PANEL_DIR 在 swebench/agent/tools.py，\n        指向 swebench/configs/tool_panels —— 但 harness 不许依赖 swebench。\n        搬到 harness/execution/panel.py + harness/tool_panels/，swebench 留 shim。\n        ⚠ 会碰 AshAgent 的主路径（老套路：搬 + shim + 测试跟着走）\n\n第二步  MCP server 接 manifest：--tools <manifest>\n        新建 mcp_exec.yaml，精确复刻现在这 4 个工具及其参数子集\n        sandbox_id 的注入仍在代码里（它是寻址，不是工具语义）\n        sandbox_create/list/destroy 继续手写（不是 runtime 工具，编译器会拒）\n\n第三步  orchestrator 透传 RunSpec(tool_manifest=…) → 起代理时带上",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "第一步  把 manifest 加载搬到能共用的位置\n        现在 load_panel / PANEL_DIR 在 swebench/agent/tools.py，\n        指向 swebench/configs/tool_panels —— 但 harness 不许依赖 swebench。\n        搬到 harness/execution/panel.py + harness/tool_panels/，swebench 留 shim。\n        ⚠ 会碰 AshAgent 的主路径（老套路：搬 + shim + 测试跟着走）\n\n第二步  MCP server 接 manifest：--tools <manifest>\n        新建 mcp_exec.yaml，精确复刻现在这 4 个工具及其参数子集\n        sandbox_id 的注入仍在代码里（它是寻址，不是工具语义）\n        sandbox_create/list/destroy 继续手写（不是 runtime 工具，编译器会拒）\n\n第三步  orchestrator 透传 RunSpec(tool_manifest=…) → 起代理时带上",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "boundElements": [],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "autoResize": true
  },
